{"chunk_id": "index-004", "document_id": "index", "content": "Docling simplifies document processing, parsing diverse formats — including advanced PDF understanding — and providing seamless integrations with the gen AI ecosystem.", "position": 4, "token_count": 32, "has_code": false, "section_hierarchy": [], "metadata": {"chunk_id": "index-004", "document_id": "index", "position": 4, "token_count": 32, "has_code": false, "overlap_with_previous": true, "section_hierarchy": [], "file_path": "index.md", "url": "/index", "title": "Untitled", "category": null, "tags": [], "section_url": "/index"}}
{"chunk_id": "index-005", "document_id": "index", "content": "## Getting started\n\n🐣 Ready to kick off your Docling journey? Let's dive right into it!\n\n ⬇️ InstallationQuickly install Docling in your environment\n ▶️ QuickstartGet a jumpstart on basic Docling usage\n 🧩 ConceptsLearn Docling fundamentals and get a glimpse under the hood\n 🧑🏽‍🍳 ExamplesTry out recipes for various use cases, including conversion, RAG, and more\n 🤖 IntegrationsCheck out integrations with popular AI tools and frameworks\n 📖 ReferenceSee more API details", "position": 5, "token_count": 101, "has_code": false, "section_hierarchy": ["Getting started"], "metadata": {"chunk_id": "index-005", "document_id": "index", "position": 5, "token_count": 101, "has_code": false, "overlap_with_previous": true, "section_hierarchy": ["Getting started"], "file_path": "index.md", "url": "/index", "title": "Untitled", "category": null, "tags": [], "section_url": "/index#getting-started"}}
{"chunk_id": "index-006", "document_id": "index", "content": "## Features", "position": 6, "token_count": 5, "has_code": false, "section_hierarchy": ["Features"], "metadata": {"chunk_id": "index-006", "document_id": "index", "position": 6, "token_count": 5, "has_code": false, "overlap_with_previous": true, "section_hierarchy": ["Features"], "file_path": "index.md", "url": "/index", "title": "Untitled", "category": null, "tags": [], "section_url": "/index#features"}}
{"chunk_id": "index-007", "document_id": "index", "content": "* 🗂️ Parsing of [multiple document formats][supported_formats] incl. PDF, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, HTML, WAV, MP3, VTT, images (PNG, TIFF, JPEG, ...), and more\n* 📑 Advanced PDF understanding incl. page layout, reading order, table structure, code, formulas, image classification, and more\n* 🧬 Unified, expressive [DoclingDocument][docling_document] representation format\n* ↪️ Various [export formats][supported_formats] and options, including Markdown, HTML, [DocTags](https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.11576) and lossless JSON\n* 🔒 Local execution capabilities for sensitive data and air-gapped environments\n* 🤖 Plug-and-play [integrations][integrations] incl. LangChain, LlamaIndex, Crew AI & Haystack for agentic AI\n* 🔍 Extensive OCR support for scanned PDFs and images", "position": 7, "token_count": 221, "has_code": false, "section_hierarchy": [], "metadata": {"chunk_id": "index-007", "document_id": "index", "position": 7, "token_count": 221, "has_code": false, "overlap_with_previous": true, "section_hierarchy": [], "file_path": "index.md", "url": "/index", "title": "Untitled", "category": null, "tags": [], "section_url": "/index"}}
{"chunk_id": "index-008", "document_id": "index", "content": "* 🔍 Extensive OCR support for scanned PDFs and images\n* 👓 Support of several Visual Language Models ([GraniteDocling](https://huggingface.co/ibm-granite/granite-docling-258M))\n* 🎙️ Support for Audio with Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) models\n* 🔌 Connect to any agent using the [Docling MCP](https://docling-project.github.io/docling/usage/mcp/) server\n* 💻 Simple and convenient CLI", "position": 8, "token_count": 113, "has_code": false, "section_hierarchy": [], "metadata": {"chunk_id": "index-008", "document_id": "index", "position": 8, "token_count": 113, "has_code": false, "overlap_with_previous": true, "section_hierarchy": [], "file_path": "index.md", "url": "/index", "title": "Untitled", "category": null, "tags": [], "section_url": "/index"}}
{"chunk_id": "index-009", "document_id": "index", "content": "### What's new\n* 📤 Structured [information extraction][extraction] \\[🧪 beta\\]\n* 📑 New layout model (**Heron**) by default, for faster PDF parsing\n* 🔌 [MCP server](https://docling-project.github.io/docling/usage/mcp/) for agentic applications\n* 💬 Parsing of Web Video Text Tracks (WebVTT) files\n\n### Coming soon\n\n* 📝 Metadata extraction, including title, authors, references & language\n* 📝 Chart understanding (Barchart, Piechart, LinePlot, etc)\n* 📝 Complex chemistry understanding (Molecular structures)", "position": 9, "token_count": 142, "has_code": false, "section_hierarchy": ["Coming soon"], "metadata": {"chunk_id": "index-009", "document_id": "index", "position": 9, "token_count": 142, "has_code": false, "overlap_with_previous": true, "section_hierarchy": ["Coming soon"], "file_path": "index.md", "url": "/index", "title": "Untitled", "category": null, "tags": [], "section_url": "/index#coming-soon"}}
{"chunk_id": "index-010", "document_id": "index", "content": "## What's next\n\n🚀 The journey has just begun! Join us and become a part of the growing Docling community.\n\n- :fontawesome-brands-github: GitHub\n- :fontawesome-brands-discord: Discord\n- :fontawesome-brands-linkedin: LinkedIn", "position": 10, "token_count": 72, "has_code": false, "section_hierarchy": ["What's next"], "metadata": {"chunk_id": "index-010", "document_id": "index", "position": 10, "token_count": 72, "has_code": false, "overlap_with_previous": true, "section_hierarchy": ["What's next"], "file_path": "index.md", "url": "/index", "title": "Untitled", "category": null, "tags": [], "section_url": "/index#whats-next"}}
{"chunk_id": "index-011", "document_id": "index", "content": "## Live assistant\n\nDo you want to leverage the power of AI and get live support on Docling?\nTry out the [Chat with Dosu](https://app.dosu.dev/097760a8-135e-4789-8234-90c8837d7f1c/ask?utm_source=github) functionalities provided by our friends at [Dosu](https://dosu.dev/).\n\n[![Chat with Dosu](https://dosu.dev/dosu-chat-badge.svg)](https://app.dosu.dev/097760a8-135e-4789-8234-90c8837d7f1c/ask?utm_source=github)", "position": 11, "token_count": 186, "has_code": false, "section_hierarchy": ["Live assistant"], "metadata": {"chunk_id": "index-011", "document_id": "index", "position": 11, "token_count": 186, "has_code": false, "overlap_with_previous": true, "section_hierarchy": ["Live assistant"], "file_path": "index.md", "url": "/index", "title": "Untitled", "category": null, "tags": [], "section_url": "/index#live-assistant"}}
{"chunk_id": "index-012", "document_id": "index", "content": "## LF AI & Data\n\nDocling is hosted as a project in the [LF AI & Data Foundation](https://lfaidata.foundation/projects/).\n\n### IBM ❤️ Open Source AI\n\nThe project was started by the AI for knowledge team at IBM Research Zurich.\n\n[supported_formats]: ./usage/supported_formats.md\n[docling_document]: ./concepts/docling_document.md\n[integrations]: ./integrations/index.md", "position": 12, "token_count": 110, "has_code": false, "section_hierarchy": ["IBM ❤️ Open Source AI"], "metadata": {"chunk_id": "index-012", "document_id": "index", "position": 12, "token_count": 110, "has_code": false, "overlap_with_previous": true, "section_hierarchy": ["IBM ❤️ Open Source AI"], "file_path": "index.md", "url": "/index", "title": "Untitled", "category": null, "tags": [], "section_url": "/index#ibm--open-source-ai"}}
